  "solution": {
    "text": "The net flux through the cube due to the external charge is zero and for the charge inside the cube, it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext>q</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;through all the surfaces. For one surface, it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext>q</mtext><mrow><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>."
